flowchart TD
    A[User input: login/search field] --> B{Input used in query?}
    B -->|String concatenation| C[Raw SQL built with user text]
    C --> D[Attacker injects: admin' --  /  ' OR 1=1 --  / UNION SELECT ...]
    D --> E[DB executes attacker-modified query]
    E --> F[Auth bypass / data leak / data tampering]

    B -->|Prepared statement| G[Query template + bound parameters]
    G --> H[Driver sends SQL and data separately]
    H --> I[DB treats input as literal value, never as code]
    I --> J[Query runs safely regardless of input content]

    style F fill:#f8b4b4,stroke:#a33
    style J fill:#b4f8c0,stroke:#2a6